<!--Context: article[@article-type=('research-article','review-article','discussion','')]//pub-history
Test: report    e:is-prc(.) and count(event[self-uri[@content-type='preprint']]) != 1
Message:  must contain one, and only one preprint event (an event with a self-uri[@content-type='preprint'] element). This one has  preprint event elements. -->
<root xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xmlns:mml="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xmlns:ali="http://www.niso.org/schemas/ali/1.0/">
